    "descriptionHtml": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Most energy products ask you to accept synthetic caffeine, artificial sweeteners, and proprietary blends just to get through your afternoon. They're counting on you not reading the label.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">FORTIFIED® doesn't work that way.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">This is clean energy hydration. 152mg of natural caffeine sourced directly from real coffee beans. Not caffeine anhydrous. Not a lab-made stimulant with a clean-sounding name. The same source humans have relied on for centuries, delivered at a dose that's meaningful without being reckless.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">The electrolyte matrix behind it is just as serious. 1,210mg of sodium from Ancient Ocean® Pink Himalayan Salt. 1,000mg of magnesium malate, one of the most bioavailable forms available. Potassium chloride. Coconut water powder from CocOganic® Plus. Real food sources, real amounts, nothing hidden behind a blend number.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Sweetened with monk fruit and fermented Reb M. Zero sugar. Zero artificial sweeteners. Zero ingredients you'd have to Google at 11pm wondering if you made the right call.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Every ingredient is on the label because every ingredient belongs there.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>152mg natural caffeine (from coffee bean) · 1,000mg magnesium malate · 1,210mg sodium</strong> Zero artificial sweeteners · Zero proprietary blends · Every milligram disclosed</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Available in Salty Orange and Salty Watermelon. 30 servings. Nothing to second-guess.<br><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><em>*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</em><br></p>",
