  {
    "id": "gid://shopify/Product/7580773122107",
    "handle": "everyday",
    "title": "Everyday Hydration Powder with D3 + K2 by FORTIFIED®",
    "status": "ACTIVE",
    "vendor": "Fortified",
    "productType": "Hydration",
    "tags": [
      "clean-label",
      "daily-hydration",
      "electrolytes",
      "hydration",
      "magnesium-malate",
      "mk-7",
      "no-caffeine",
      "no-sugar",
      "pink-himalayan-salt",
      "subscription",
      "vitamin-d3",
      "vitamin-k2"
    ],
    "descriptionHtml": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Most hydration powders give you electrolytes and call it done. They're solving for the workout. Nobody built one for the other 23 hours of your day.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">FORTIFIED® doesn't work that way.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">This is daily hydration with something to say. The same clean electrolyte foundation as FORTIFIED® Energy, without the caffeine, and fortified with two nutrients most people are quietly running low on every single day. Vitamin D3 at 130% of your daily value. Vitamin K2 as MK-7, the form your body can actually use. Together, not separately, because that's how they work best.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Vitamin D3 without K2 is a conversation half finished. Research increasingly points to their relationship in supporting where calcium actually ends up in the body.* Most supplements ignore that. <strong>FORTIFIED® Everyday doesn't.</strong></p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">No caffeine, so you can take it any time of day. No artificial sweeteners, no proprietary blends, no ingredients that require a biochemistry degree to evaluate. Just clean, foundational daily nutrition. Fully disclosed. Every milligram on the label because every milligram belongs there.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">This one is for the long game. The daily ritual. The version of you that's thinking six months ahead, not just six minutes.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>25mcg Vitamin D3 (130% DV) · Vitamin K2 MK-7 · 1,000mg magnesium malate · 1,210mg sodium</strong> Zero caffeine · Zero artificial sweeteners · Every milligram disclosed</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Available in Salty Orange and Salty Watermelon. 30 servings. Make it a ritual.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><em>*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</em></p>",
