  {
    "id": "gid://shopify/Product/7580773384251",
    "handle": "creatine",
    "title": "Creatine Monohydrate Pure Unflavored by FORTIFIED®",
    "status": "ACTIVE",
    "vendor": "Fortified",
    "productType": "Supplements",
    "tags": [
      "clean-label",
      "creatine",
      "creatine-monohydrate",
      "one-ingredient",
      "recovery",
      "strength",
      "subscription",
      "supplements",
      "unflavored",
      "womens-supplements"
    ],
    "descriptionHtml": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Most creatine products ask you to accept artificial flavors, sweeteners, and fillers just to get the one thing you came for.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">FORTIFIED® doesn't work that way.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">This is pure creatine monohydrate. 5 grams per serving. One ingredient. Nothing else in the pouch. One of the most studied compounds in nutritional science, delivered at the dose the research actually used, with nothing added to compromise it.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Your body already produces creatine naturally. FORTIFIED® just gives it more to work with. More strength, more power output, better recovery from the work you're already putting in.* And if you're a woman who's been told creatine isn't for you, the research disagrees. It's not a gym supplement. It's a foundational nutrient. One most of us aren't getting enough of from food alone.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">No flavors. No sweeteners. No fillers. One ingredient on the label because one ingredient is all that's in it.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>5g creatine monohydrate per serving · 45 servings · Pure unflavored</strong> One ingredient · Zero additives · Zero sweeteners · Fully disclosed</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">45 servings. One ingredient. Nothing to second-guess.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><em>*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</em></p>",
